    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that but it feels like such a cliche. \"it gets better,\" \"talk to someone\"... it's just noise. i'm trying to write something that actually feels honest about this. i keep thinking about how the most beautiful things in art are often about destruction or things that are gone forever. like, maybe part of the reason it feels so empty is because i'm trying to hold onto something that should have just ended already.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
